# Per-run server stdout from the E2E harness.  Each run writes a fresh
# `server-hc-e2e-<random>.log`; they are debugging scraps, not evidence.
# The curated `server-src.log` / `server-dst.log` beside a result stay
# tracked because a reader needs them to interpret that result.
plans/evidence/**/server-hc-e2e-*.log

